cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Grid Generation for Curvilinear Field-Line-Following
  Coordinates
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software
  (via the Zenodo DOI below) and the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Houjun
    family-names: Wang
    email: wanghoujun@gmail.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1462-5234'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/wanghj2015/grid-generation'
abstract: >-
  Fortran code for generating curvilinear magnetic
  field-line-following coordinate systems for
  ionosphere-plasmasphere modeling. It builds an analytical
  axis-centered dipole coordinate generator and a general
  generator that traces field lines through the IGRF
  geomagnetic field.
keywords:
  - ionosphere
  - plasmasphere
  - geomagnetic field
  - IGRF
  - field-line-following coordinates
  - curvilinear coordinates
  - dipole
license: MIT
